        "date": "2026-11-21",
        "title": "05-Nov-26 Report Alignment & Nov-26 Operational Update",
        "source": "Pipeline Report (05-Nov-26) / Tullow Nov-26 Trading Update",
        "status": "Desk Synthesis",
        "summary": "Converted credit_view.verdict to structured schema and aligned stance to Neutral/Cautious following the $393.09m ICC Ghana tax award against ~$0.3bn liquidity headroom, despite solid Jubilee/TEN uptime and Nov-28 maturity runway."
